></td>\n<td><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"> 4–0  </span></td>\n<td><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"> 3–0  </span></td>\n<td><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"> 6–1 </span></td>\n<td><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"> 4–1  </span></td>\n<td><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"> 7–1\n </span></td>\n<td style=\"background:#eee;text-align:center;color:#aaa;\">&#8212;</td> \n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Skytteligan\">Skytteligan</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_1924/1925&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Skytteligan\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_1924/1925&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Skytteligan\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fil:Svarte_Filip.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/78/Svarte_Filip.jpg/250px-Svarte_Filip.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"190\" height=\"252\" style=\"--mw-file-upright: 0.75\" class=\"mw-file-element mw-file-upright\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/78/Svarte_Filip.jpg/500px-Svarte_Filip.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1000\" data-file-height=\"1324\" /></a><figcaption><a href=\"/wiki/Filip_Johansson\" title=\"Filip Johansson\">\"Svarte Filip\" Johansson</a> i <a href=\"/wiki/IFK_G%C3%B6teborg\" title=\"IFK Göteborg\">IFK Göteborg</a> blev oöverträffad skyttekung i den första allsvenskan med hela 39 mål. IFK rådde dock inte på lokalkonkurrenten Gais, som tog det allsvenska guldet.</figcaption></figure>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Rank\n</th>\n<th width=\"200\">Spelare\n</th>\n<th width=\"135\">Lag\n</th>\n<th width=\"40\">Mål\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">1\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sverige\" title=\"Sverige\"><img alt=\"Sverige\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/40px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/60px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1600\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Filip_Johansson\" title=\"Filip Johansson\">Filip Johansson</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/IFK_G%C3%B6teborg\" title=\"IFK Göteborg\">IFK Göteborg</a>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">39\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">2\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sverige\" title=\"Sverige\"><img alt=\"Sverige\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/40px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/60px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1600\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sven_Rydell\" title=\"Sven Rydell\">Sven Rydell</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96rgryte_IS\" title=\"Örgryte IS\">Örgryte IS</a>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">22\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">3\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sverige\" title=\"Sverige\"><img alt=\"Sverige\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/40px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/60px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1600\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gunnar_Rydberg\" title=\"Gunnar Rydberg\">Gunnar Rydberg</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/IFK_G%C3%B6teborg\" title=\"IFK Göteborg\">IFK Göteborg</a>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">21\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\">4\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sverige\" title=\"Sverige\"><img alt=\"Sverige\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/40px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/60px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1600\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Carl-Erik_Holmberg\" title=\"Carl-Erik Holmberg\">Carl-Erik Holmberg</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96rgryte_IS\" title=\"Örgryte IS\">Örgryte IS</a>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\">18\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sverige\" title=\"Sverige\"><img alt=\"Sverige\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/40px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/60px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1600\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Albert_Olsson_(fotbollsspelare)\" title=\"Albert Olsson (fotbollsspelare)\">Albert Olsson</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Gais\" title=\"Gais\">Gais</a>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Allsvenska_seriesegrarna\">Allsvenska seriesegrarna</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_1924/1925&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Allsvenska seriesegrarna\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_1924/1925&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Allsvenska seriesegrarna\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fil:Abben_Olsson,_GAIS_1919.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4d/Abben_Olsson%2C_GAIS_1919.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"190\" height=\"253\" style=\"--mw-file-upright: 0.75\" class=\"mw-file-element mw-file-upright\" data-file-width=\"243\" data-file-height=\"323\" /></a><figcaption>Albert \"Abben\" Olsson blev Gais bäste målskytt med sina 18 mål på 20 matcher.</figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"noprint\" style=\"font-style:italic; ;\">\n<dl><dd>Se även&#58; <a href=\"/wiki/Gais_1924/1925\" title=\"Gais 1924/1925\">Gais 1924/1925</a></dd></dl></div>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Gais\" title=\"Gais\">Gais</a>-spelare i allsvenskan 1924/25:\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"background: #FFFFFF;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th><b>Namn</b>\n</th>\n<th><b>Matcher</b>\n</th>\n<th><b>Mål</b>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Rune_Wenzel\" title=\"Rune Wenzel\">Rune Wenzel</a></td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td>5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Gunnar_Holmberg_(fotbollsspelare)\" title=\"Gunnar Holmberg (fotbollsspelare)\">Gunnar Holmberg</a></td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Erik_%22Snejsarn%22_Johansson\" title=\"Erik &quot;Snejsarn&quot; Johansson\">Erik Johansson</a></td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Albert_Olsson_(fotbollsspelare)\" title=\"Albert Olsson (fotbollsspelare)\">Albert Olsson</a></td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>18\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Bror_Carlsson\" title=\"Bror Carlsson\">Bror Carlsson</a></td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>12\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Thorsten_Svensson\" title=\"Thorsten Svensson\">Thorsten Svensson</a></td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>7\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Herbert_Lundgren\" title=\"Herbert Lundgren\">Herbert Lundgren</a></td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Gustaf_Gustafsson_(fotbollsspelare)\" title=\"Gustaf Gustafsson (fotbollsspelare)\">Gustaf Gustafsson</a></td>\n<td>19</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Fritjof_Hill%C3%A9n\" title=\"Fritjof Hillén\">Fritjof Hillén</a></td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Sigurd_Mattiasson\" title=\"Sigurd Mattiasson\">Sigurd Mattiasson</a> (mv)</td>\n<td>13</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Gunnar_Paulsson\" title=\"Gunnar Paulsson\">Gunnar Paulsson</a></td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>9\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Albert_Liljedahl\" title=\"Albert Liljedahl\">Albert Liljedahl</a></td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>6\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Konrad_Hirsch\" title=\"Konrad Hirsch\">Konrad Hirsch</a></td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Manfred_Johnsson\" title=\"Manfred Johnsson\">Manfred Johnsson</a> (mv)</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Arvid_Bj%C3%B6rk_(fotbollsspelare)\" title=\"Arvid Björk (fotbollsspelare)\">Arvid Björk</a></td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Nils_Andreasson\" title=\"Nils Andreasson\">Nils Andreasson</a></td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Fridolf_Jonsson\" title=\"Fridolf Jonsson\">Fridolf Jonsson</a></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Nils_Karlsson_(fotbollsspelare)\" title=\"Nils Karlsson (fotbollsspelare)\">Nils Karlsson</a></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Albert_Lindgren\" title=\"Albert Lindgren\">Albert Lindgren</a></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Kommentarer\">Kommentarer</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_1924/1925&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Kommentarer\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_1924/1925&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Kommentarer\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r56657865\">.mw-parser-output .fotnotslista .references{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .skin-minerva .fotnotslista .references{list-style-type:lower-alpha}</style><div class=\"fotnotslista\" style=\"list-style-type: lower-alpha;\"><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\" data-mw-group=\"not\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-7\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-7\">^</a> <span class=\"reference-text\">Bollen tog i ribbans underkant och lär enligt AIK:s historieskrivning sedan ha tagit mark en halvmeter <i>innanför</i> mållinjen. En oplacerad domare skulle därefter ha ignorerat linjemannens målsignal.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Källor\"><span id=\"K.C3.A4llor\"></span>Källor</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_1924/1925&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Källor\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_1924/1925&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Källor\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20150120054827/https://www.allsvenskan.se/tabell/arkiv-19241925/#omgaang-0\">Allsvenskan.se</a></li>\n<li><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r58662249\">@media screen,handheld,projection{.mw-parser-output cite .printonly{display:none}}</style><cite style=\"font-style:normal\" class=\"web\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://bolletinen.se/sfs_statistik/sfs_allsvenskan_herrar/sfs_allsvenskan_1924.htm\">”Bolletinen”</a>. SFS<span class=\"printonly\">. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://bolletinen.se/sfs_statistik/sfs_allsvenskan_herrar/sfs_allsvenskan_1924.htm\">https://bolletinen.se/sfs_statistik/sfs_allsvenskan_herrar/sfs_allsvenskan_1924.htm</a></span><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">.&#32;Läst 10 okt 2024</span>.</cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.btitle=Bolletinen&amp;rft.atitle=&amp;rft.pub=SFS&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fbolletinen.se%2Fsfs&#95;statistik%2Fsfs&#95;allsvenskan&#95;herrar%2Fsfs&#95;allsvenskan&#95;1924.htm&amp;rfr&#95;id=info:sid/en.wikipedia.org:Fotbollsallsvenskan&#95;1924/1925\"><span style=\"display: none;\">&#160;</span></span></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Referenser\">Referenser</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_1924/1925&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Referenser\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"